{% extends "_includes/layout.njk" %}

{% block content %}
	<header class="hero-section">
		<section class="hero-content">
			<div class="hero-text-group">
				<img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/fc65f0eb630fe0b35f46062548b7184f40eefeb9.jpg" class="avatar">
				<h1>Ethan Shaw</h1>
				<p class="tagline">一颗尘埃 一枚星星</p>
			</div>
			<img src="../images/ZhouShenALPHA.webp" class="person-img" fetchpriority="high">
		</section>
	</header>

	<main class="content-section">
		<section class="container">
			<section id="about" class="section-content about-text">
				<h2 class="section-title">关于我</h2>
				<p>Hi，我是 Ethan，</p>
				<p>一个业余音乐爱好者，</p>
				<p>一枚深沉地爱着<a href="https://weibo.com/u/1736988591">周深</a>的「生米」，</p>
				<p>一位努力奋斗的中学生。</p>
				<p>作为一个 up 主，</p>
				<p>我很荣幸在 <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1863501530">Bilibili</a> 上有 3000+ 粉丝。</p>
				<p>我把视频创作看作一种放松，</p>
				<p>但我会一直保持高质。</p>
				<p>现实中，我，就是 Ethan，</p>
				<p>努力爱着这个世界的 Ethan——</p>
				<p>无论如何，会更好的。</p>
				<p>最后，</p>
				<p>爱你们，朋友们，</p>
				<p>你们每个人的出现，</p>
				<p>都是我生命中的幸运；</p>
				<p>爱你，深深，</p>
				<p>永远期待我们的每一次相遇。</p>
			</section>

			<section id="milestones" class="section-content">
				<h2 class="section-title">里程碑</h2>
				<p class="section-hint">左右滑动浏览</p>
				<div class="filter-container">
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2011', this)">2011</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2017', this)">2017</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2018', this)">2018</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2019', this)">2019</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2020', this)">2020</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2022', this)">2022</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2023', this)">2023</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2024', this)">2024</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2025', this)">2025</button>
					<button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterMilestones('2026', this)">2026</button>
				</div>
				<div class="milestone-container">
					<button class="milestone-nav-btn prev" onclick="scrollMilestones(-1)" aria-label="上一个">
						<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M31 36L19 24L31 12"/></svg>
					</button>
					<div class="milestone-wrapper" id="milestoneScrollContainer">
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2011">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-life">人生</span>2011.03.30</div>
							<h3>世界，你好</h3>
							<p>这一天，我来到了这个世界。那是一段漫长旅程的序章。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2017">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-skill">技能</span>2017</div>
							<h3>初探旋律</h3>
							<p>我开始真正地接触音乐，在琴键与五线谱的世界里遨游。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2017">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-academic">学业</span>2017.09</div>
							<h3>学业伊始</h3>
							<p>我踏入了小学的大门，开始了漫长而充实的学习之旅。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2018">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-life">人生</span>2018.07</div>
							<h3>生命的馈赠</h3>
							<p>我可爱的妹妹的诞生，给生活中添加了成倍的欢笑。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2019">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-nation">家国</span>2019.10.01</div>
							<h3>盛世华诞</h3>
							<p>中华人民共和国成立 70 周年。那次大会是我记忆中的第一次阅兵式。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2020">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>2020.04</div>
							<h3>初次邂逅，成为「生米」</h3>
							<p>偶然，我听到了那纯净空灵的嗓音——那是周深的《大鱼》。我逐渐成为了一个「生米」。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2020">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-skill">技能</span>2020</div>
							<h3>翰墨人生</h3>
							<p>我开始学习毛笔书法。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2022">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2022.01.03</div>
							<h3>首次起航</h3>
							<p>我在 Bilibili 发布了第一支早期视频。虽然它早已在时间中隐去，但创作热情自此点燃。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2022">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2022.02.02</div>
							<h3>万分之一的缘分</h3>
							<p>Bilibili 频道迎来了第一位粉丝。这份微小的鼓励，却让我首次感受到热爱的力量。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2022">
							<div class="date">
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-nation">家国</span>
								2022.04
							</div>
							<h3>有你，有我</h3>
							<p>《有我》在中国共青团将成立 100 周年之际发布，周深空灵但有力的歌声令人动容。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2022">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-life">人生</span>2022.06.25</div>
							<h3>数字窗口</h3>
							<p>我拥有了第一台专属于我的手机。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2022">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>2022.09</div>
							<h3>花开忘忧，愿你无忧</h3>
							<p>听着《花开忘忧》，我竟不自觉落了泪，或许是触动了内心深处最温柔的防线吧。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2022">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2022.12.29</div>
							<h3>音高探索</h3>
							<p>我发布了首支「音高测量」系列视频。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2023.01.29</div>
							<h3>百人同行</h3>
							<p>Bilibili 频道粉丝突破 100。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-life">人生</span>2023.04.15</div>
							<h3>首台电脑</h3>
							<p>我拥有了人生第一台笔记本电脑。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2023.04</div>
							<h3>更上一层楼</h3>
							<p>视频剪辑工具从剪映专业版正式升级为 DaVinci Resolve。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>2023.05</div>
							<h3>璀璨冒险人</h3>
							<p>耳机里，那首《璀璨冒险人》已循环了上百遍。这首歌总能赋予我重新出发的勇气。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-academic">学业</span>2023.06</div>
							<h3>告别童年</h3>
							<p>小学毕业了。一段纯真时光的终点，也是通往更广阔天地的新起点。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2023.07</div>
							<h3>专业进化</h3>
							<p>工作流全面转向 Adobe Premiere <i>Pro</i>。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-life">人生</span>2023.08</div>
							<h3>波折与磨砺</h3>
							<p>这一个月以来，我经历了地震、交通事故和猫伤。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-academic">学业</span>2023.09</div>
							<h3>少年的远征</h3>
							<p>我正式升入初中。课业压力如约而至，但我知道，这是必须跨越的山峰。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2023">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2023.11.04</div>
							<h3>五百之约</h3>
							<p>Bilibili 频道粉丝数达到 500。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2024">
							<div class="date">
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-life">人生</span>
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>
								2024.03.30
							</div>
							<h3>13 岁与《蜃楼》</h3>
							<p>13 岁生日当天，二专先行曲《蜃楼》官宣。这是万千时空交错下，最完美的生日礼物。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2024">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>2024.05.19</div>
							<h3>《反深代词》</h3>
							<p>周深新专辑《反深代词》终于开售！毫不犹豫首发购入，去探索更深邃的音乐宇宙。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2024">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2024.06.26</div>
							<h3>千人同行</h3>
							<p>Bilibili 频道粉丝破千了！</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2024">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-community">社群</span>2024.07.29</div>
							<h3>温暖港湾</h3>
							<p>QQ 交流群正式建立。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2024">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-anecdote">轶事</span>2024.08.09</div>
							<h3>连胜挑战</h3>
							<p>在多邻国开启了第 1 天连胜，延续至今。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2024">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2023 - 2024</div>
							<h3>质的飞跃</h3>
							<p>经历了长时间的摸索，我的视频质量有了质的提升，我找到了自己的节奏。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2025.01</div>
							<h3>两千份信任</h3>
							<p>Bilibili 频道粉丝数达到 2,000！</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-achievement">成就</span>2025.01.29</div>
							<h3>跨洋共鸣</h3>
							<p>收到 Armando 的回信，在全中文互联网首个获得了《山鹰之歌》的原始歌词。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-academic">学业</span>2025.06.15</div>
							<h3>首场战斗</h3>
							<p>迎来初二地理生物中考。这是我学业生涯的第一次正式亮剑。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>2025.06.28</div>
							<h3>「深深的」青岛站</h3>
							<p>深深，我们在「深深的」相遇了！在彼此的人生日记上，我们都留下了浓墨重彩的一笔。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2025.07.31</div>
							<h3>走向世界</h3>
							<p>正式开通 YouTube 频道。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-achievement">成就</span>2025.08.19</div>
							<h3>《重逢之约》极高音？</h3>
							<p>收到 Brian Cheng 老师的回复，结束了《重逢之约》中所谓「极高音」的乌龙。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-nation">家国</span>2025.09.03</div>
							<h3>回望历史</h3>
							<p>纪念抗战胜利 80 周年。中国再也不会受到那样的屈辱了。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-insync">同频</span>2025.09.29</div>
							<h3>提前的祝愿</h3>
							<p>为深深精心创作生贺视频。预见到高中生活的忙碌，我提前寄存了未来几年的祝福。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2025.10.01</div>
							<h3>多维分享</h3>
							<p>开通小红书频道。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2025">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>2025.10</div>
							<h3>三千份热爱</h3>
							<p>Bilibili 频道粉丝数达到 3,000。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2026">
							<div class="date">
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-academic">学业</span>
								2026
							</div>
							<h3>潜龙在渊</h3>
							<p>为了迎接至关重要的中考，更新速度明显放缓。短暂的沉寂，是为了更好的爆发。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2026">
							<div class="date">
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-channel">频道</span>
								<span class="milestone-tag tag-nation">家国</span>
								2026.03.04
							</div>
							<h3>多元民族</h3>
							<p>发布《吉量》民族标注版，向世界传递中华文化的光芒。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="2026">
							<div class="date"><span class="milestone-tag tag-academic">学业</span>2026.05</div>
							<h3>沃土开花</h3>
							<p>通过市一中「沃土计划」考试，理想高中的大门已近在眼前。</p>
						</div>
						<div class="milestone-card" data-year="all">
							<div class="date">Future</div>
							<h3>未完待续……</h3>
							<p>更多的经历，更多的冒险。时间的长河还在流淌，我的人生日记仍在继续书写……</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button class="milestone-nav-btn next" onclick="scrollMilestones(1)" aria-label="下一个">
						<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M19 12L31 24L19 36"/></svg>
					</button>
				</div>
			</section>

